  "limitations": [
    "GitHub CI remains manually disabled by user direction. No workflow, remote branch or separate CI repair work is part of this requirement.",
    "All execution evidence is local and mock-only. No real model/provider delivery or external business-state mutation is claimed. Mock receipts report that no external side effect occurred.",
    "Read-role behavior uses operator-supplied content and explicitly supplied structured evidence. It is not live social, CRM, spreadsheet, CMS or fulfillment monitoring, and missing evidence is not replaced with fabricated metrics.",
    "All 43 manual dry-run instances comprise 37 read-role simulations and six write-role proposal previews. Preview proposed_actions are document content only; explicit mock execution and independent approval are separate boundaries.",
    "An already-planned inert preview retains its admitted configuration snapshot; later instance configuration changes do not automatically revoke it. Explicit run cancellation is the stop boundary. A write's current-configuration check does not revoke a call already in flight.",
    "Write-only mock completion is represented by durable connector receipts, not a fabricated catalog output artifact. This requirement does not claim live delivery or additional capabilities for those roles.",
    "Legacy schedules remain retained but cannot become executable without an explicit schema-valid saved input and mode. Supported trigger/mode combinations remain registry constrained.",
    "New scheduled-input editor behavior is unit/API/process-tested. The WEB-03 browser gate uses production frontend rendering with real hierarchy/detail reads and route-mocked configuration responses; it does not prove browser-to-worker scheduled or approved-write completion.",
    "SQLite populated migration/rollback behavior is executed. PostgreSQL offline DDL compilation is not PostgreSQL runtime verification; optional PostgreSQL skips are not compatibility passes.",
    "The matrix records scoped locally tested behavior, not a commit-bound attestation or whole-system acceptance. Every declared gate and the restored-base connection witness must independently pass against the frozen feature before merge; generated attestation remains outside Git."
  ]
